 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Heart Catch — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>After mastering Reverse Cursed Technique, you have unlocked your cursed technique reversal. You are now able to summon small feet which disrupt the focus of creatures. As an action for 4 cursed energy, you may shoot out a bunch of little feet in a 30 foot cone. Creatures in this cone must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they take 5d6 bludgeoning damage and are frightened for 1 minute. On a success, they take half damage and are not frightened. Frightened creatures can repeat the save at the end of their turns.</p>",
